      "title": "NULLXES ARACHNE — loaders",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# NULLXES ARACHNE-X — ComfyUI loader stack\n\n**Nodes:** ComfyUI-WanVideoWrapper branch `longcat_avatar`\n```\ngit clone -b longcat_avatar https://github.com/kijai/ComfyUI-WanVideoWrapper.git\n```\n\n**Comfy cannot load RunPod HF folders** (`avatar_single/`, `dit/` shards).\nUse **Kijai comfy single-file** weights (same lineage as ARACHNE-X-ULTRA-*):\nhttps://huggingface.co/Kijai/LongCat-Video_comfy\n\n## Avatar (this graph)\n| File | ComfyUI path |\n|------|----------------|\n| LongCat-Avatar bf16 | `models/diffusion_models/LongCat/LongCat-Avatar_bf16.safetensors` |\n| LongCat-Avatar fp8 single | `models/diffusion_models/LongCat/LongCat-Avatar-single_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled_mixed_KJ.safetensors` |\n| distill LoRA (opt) | `models/loras/LongCat_distill_lora_rank128_bf16.safetensors` |\n| Wan VAE | `models/vae/Wan2_1_VAE_bf16.safetensors` |\n| UMT5 | `models/text_encoders/umt5-xxl-enc-bf16.safetensors` |\n| CLIP vision | `models/clip_vision/clip_vision_h.safetensors` |\n\n## VIDEO (separate graph / swap ModelLoader widget)\n| File | ComfyUI path |\n|------|----------------|\n| LongCat TI2V fp8 | `models/diffusion_models/LongCat/LongCat_TI2V_comfy_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled_KJ.safetensors` |\n| refinement LoRA | `models/loras/LongCat_refinement_lora_rank128_bf16.safetensors` |\n\n## RunPod CLI (production, not Comfy)\n```\nexport NULLXES_CHECKPOINT_DIR=/workspace/ARACHNE-X/weights/arachne-avatar-runtime\npython scripts/infer.py --checkpoint_dir \"$NULLXES_CHECKPOINT_DIR\" --mode ai2v ...\n```\n\n**Extend:** wire `WANVIDEOMODEL` + `WANVAE` + inputs into WanVideoSamplerv2 / LongCatAvatar embeds."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
